 all tablespoon and a half  of gelatin then pour the mixture into  champagne flutes pop in a few fresh  strawberries and refrigerate for a few  hours until set there you have it three  sparkling desserts me with love bubbles  and strawberries that will guarantee you  more action than that a card ever could  a big happy Valentine's Day from my  kitchen to yours for more great tips and  recipes on how to fall back in love with  food be sure to subscribe to my channel  and I'll see you next time on Abby's  kitchen
 

